  <h1>Research</h1>

 <p>
  My research interests lie in mathematical and statistical methodology for spatially
  structured biomedical data, particularly histopathology images, single-cell data, and
  related imaging-derived measurements.
</p>

<p>
  I am currently interested in spatial statistics, marked point process methods,
  topological data analysis, and statistical methodology for structured biological data.
  More broadly, I am interested in scientific settings where mathematical structure and
  statistical inference play a central role in the formulation of the problem.
</p>

<h2>Fields of Interest</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Spatial statistics</li>
  <li>Topological data analysis</li>
  <li>Computational pathology and biomedical imaging</li>
</ul>

